<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ SpecMind: Cognitively Inspired, Interactive Multi-Turn Framework for Postcondition Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A.5</span> </span>Example Trajectory of Reasoning Categories</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ SpecMind: Cognitively Inspired, Interactive Multi-Turn Framework for Postcondition Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A.6</span> </span>Usage of LLM Assistance</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
