<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SpecMind</span>: Cognitively Inspired, Interactive Multi-Turn Framework for Postcondition Inference</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Cuong Chi Le
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
