</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id5" class="ltx_text">VinUniversity</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">   </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Cuong Duc Van
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id6" class="ltx_text">FPT Software AI Center</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">   </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
