</span></td>
<td id="S6.T2.8.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S6.T2.8.8.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">129</span></td>
<td id="S6.T2.8.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
<span id="S6.T2.8.8.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="S6.T2.8.8.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.T2.8.8.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">"The assertion is now concise and readable. It correctly checks…, let’s consider submitting it…"</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
