<li id="bib.bib6" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Cousot <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2012)</span>
